OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHot and sunny in the southeast.
OL,6,FIncreasingly humid for Wales and
OL,7,Fwestern/northern England with variable
OL,8,Fcloud and possible afternoon
OL,9,Fthunderstorms. Fresher, albeit rather
OL,10,Fcloudy, conditions for Northern
OL,11,FIreland and Scotland after early heavy
OL,12,Fand thundery rain clears the east.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FThunderstorms pushing
OL,15,Feastwards overnight, with heavy
OL,16,Fdownpours particularly possible over
OL,17,Feastern England. Warm and muggy in the
OL,18,Fsoutheast, but fresher than recent
OL,19,Fnights elsewhere. A few showers for
OL,20,Fnorthern Scotland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
