OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FStill very warm and humid
OL,6,Ffor southeast England as heavy showers
OL,7,Fand thunderstorms clear. Widely fine
OL,8,Felsewhere with sunny spells and nearer
OL,9,Faverage temperatures, though showers
OL,10,Fcontinuing for northern Scotland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
